WEBVTT

00:05:28.876 --> 00:05:32.436
Underwater Homeowners Association meetings

00:05:32.436 --> 00:05:34.116
where people came together

00:05:34.116 --> 00:05:36.116
and they learned from relevant scientists

00:05:36.116 --> 00:05:37.516
and experts and practitioners

00:05:37.556 --> 00:05:41.356
and ultimately began planning for a future

00:05:41.396 --> 00:05:43.356
with faulty septic tanks

00:05:43.396 --> 00:05:46.796
and risky real estate

00:05:46.836 --> 00:05:48.876
and water that would rise,

00:05:49.276 --> 00:05:52.236
but unlike a hurricane storm surge,

00:05:52.236 --> 00:05:53.956
will not recede.

00:05:57.916 --> 00:06:00.316
I want to emphasize
what I'm talking about here.